  "longBusinessSummary": "BigRep SE produces 3D printing solutions in Germany, Austria, the United States, and Singapore. It offers 3D printers for industrial additive manufacturing; dry cabinets to protect filament from material degradation; BVOH, PA12 CF, PETG, PLA, PLX, HI-TEMP CF, rPLA, rPETG, and PRO HT filaments; and parts and accessories, including power extruders. The company also provides CONNECT, a one-stop platform to connect with printers; BLADE, a slicing software. It serves industrial, business solution and consumer products, automotive, transportation, aerospace, and logistics, as well as government and education industries. The company was formerly known as SMG Technology Acceleration SE. BigRep SE was incorporated in 2014 and is headquartered in Luxembourg, Luxembourg.",
